+| `rust/tcl-compiler/src/place_bridge.rs` | 2 | the `arg_roles` axis — `namespace upvar` positions by name |
+| `rust/tcl-compiler/src/shimmer/thunking.rs` | 1 | the `native_lowering` axis — a thunked `break` |
